## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: ge-versamax-ic200cpue05
name: "GE VersaMax IC200CPUE05 — 64KB, 0.8ms/K Boolean, RS-232/RS-485+Ethernet 10Mbps, EGD/SRTP, NTP, DIN-rail modular PLC"
manufacturer: "GE Intelligent Platforms (now Emerson Automation Solutions)"
mcu: "Proprietary embedded processor — 0.8ms/K boolean; hardware FPU; battery-backed RAM + system flash NV"
category: plc
image: ge-versamax-ic200cpue05.svg
url: "https://www.emerson.com/en-us/catalog/emerson-versamax-plc"

